---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import '../styles/mission/mission.css';
import missionImage from '../assets/images/our-mission.png';
---

<section class="mission">
  <div class="container mission__container">
    <div class="mission__content">
      <span class="mission__label">Our Mission</span>
      <h2 class="mission__title">We Are On A Mission To <br/> Deliver Excellence In <br/> Commercial Kitchen Solutions.</h2>
      <p class="mission__text">
        At Steelcraft, we believe that the heart of every successful hospitality venture is a well-designed, efficient kitchen. Our mission is to provide the UAE's hospitality and food service sectors with premium-grade stainless steel equipment that combines industrial durability with ergonomic design.
      </p>
      <p class="mission__text">
        With over 16 years of expertise in the Gulf region, we have built our reputation on precision, reliability, and local manufacturing excellence. We empower chefs and operators to achieve their best work by providing the invisible infrastructure that makes great culinary experiences possible.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mission__side">
      <div class="mission__image-wrap">
        <Image
          src={missionImage}
          alt="Our mission visual"
          class="mission__image"
          width={800}
          height={600}
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="mission__quote">
        <p class="mission__quote-text">
          "Steelcraft transformed our central kitchen operation. Their custom-built prep stations and refrigeration solutions were perfectly specified for our high-volume production needs in the Dubai climate."
        </p>
        <p class="mission__quote-author">Executive Chef</p>
        <p class="mission__quote-role">Hospitality Group, UAE</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
